{"id": "34346", "title": "恶魔的圈套", "author": "宝贝", "category": "文学名著", "count": 34, "available": 0, "cover": "", "status": "已完成", "source": "files/article/info/34/34346.htm", "intro": "他分明就是个恶魔，不分青红皂白就依造反罪将她全家关进宛如地狱的东狱里，任谁都知道东狱是进得去却出不来的坟场啊！她不在乎自已的生死，却不愿让家人含冤莫白。而他明明看出她的满腔恨意，竟还将她放了出来，摆出一副不服气就来找他算帐的讨厌样，接下战帖，她决心找出证据为家人平反，但天不从人愿，她被迫住进他府里，她以不吃不喝来表达抗议，他嘴上冷嘲热讽的，却亲自为她端汤送药，还默默守了她一整夜，不明白，她真的不明白他到底存着什么心……", "base": "files/article/html/34/34346", "chapters": [{"title": "楔子", "file": "2182420.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第1页", "file": "2182421.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第2页", "file": "2182422.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第3页", "file": "2182423.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第4页", "file": "2182424.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第5页", "file": "2182425.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第6页", "file": "2182426.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第7页", "file": "2182427.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第8页", "file": "2182428.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第9页", "file": "2182429.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第10页", "file": "2182430.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第11页", "file": "2182431.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第12页", "file": "2182432.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第13页", "file": "2182433.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第14页", "file": "2182434.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第15页", "file": "2182435.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第16页", "file": "2182436.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第17页", "file": "2182437.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第18页", "file": "2182438.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第19页", "file": "2182439.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第20页", "file": "2182440.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第21页", "file": "2182441.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第22页", "file": "2182442.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第23页", "file": "2182443.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第24页", "file": "2182444.html", "availa